# Guard: never accidentally commit RAW pane captures dropped here while curating a new
# sample. The committed corpus is *.json (capture text + blessed expected, bundled) —
# curated by hand and repo-safe. Raw scratch captures (.txt) and rendered PNGs from
# `python -m research.probe --save` are working files, not corpus; keep them local.
#
# A committed sample is invented from scratch, never a real capture renamed or redacted
# (AGENTS.md: "This repository is public"): rebuild only the structure that triggers
# the case, around an unrelated topic, with neutral paths like ~/src/example-app.
*.txt
*.png
